--- !u!114 &812261596
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 812261595}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fdf766402a0b8d743a1f8cd1d23c8e87, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::VNDialogueSequence
  sequence:
  - multipleCharacter: 0
    character: {fileID: 297154306}
    expression: 3
    triggerExpressionAnimation: 1
    character1: {fileID: 0}
    expression1: 0
    triggerExpressionAnimation1: 0
    character2: {fileID: 0}
    expression2: 0
    triggerExpressionAnimation2: 0
    focusCharacter1: 0
    focusCharacter2: 0
    nameToShow: Character 2
    dub: {fileID: 0}
    text: Oraaaaaa!
  - multipleCharacter: 0
    character: {fileID: 297154306}
    expression: 1
    triggerExpressionAnimation: 0
    character1: {fileID: 0}
    expression1: 0
    triggerExpressionAnimation1: 0
    character2: {fileID: 0}
    expression2: 0
    triggerExpressionAnimation2: 0
    focusCharacter1: 0
    focusCharacter2: 0
    nameToShow: Character 2
    dub: {fileID: 0}
    text: I will become stronger than any mage that has ever lived!
  - multipleCharacter: 0
    character: {fileID: 297154306}
    expression: 0
    triggerExpressionAnimation: 0
    character1: {fileID: 0}
    expression1: 0
    triggerExpressionAnimation1: 0
    character2: {fileID: 0}
    expression2: 0
    triggerExpressionAnimation2: 0
    focusCharacter1: 0
    focusCharacter2: 0
    nameToShow: Character 2
    dub: {fileID: 0}
    text: Even stronger than That Grand Magus Gemumin!
  - multipleCharacter: 1
    character: {fileID: 0}
    expression: 0
    triggerExpressionAnimation: 1
    character1: {fileID: 297154306}
    expression1: 0
    triggerExpressionAnimation1: 0
    character2: {fileID: 1000891122}
    expression2: 0
    triggerExpressionAnimation2: 1
    focusCharacter1: 0
    focusCharacter2: 1
    nameToShow: Character 2
    dub: {fileID: 0}
    text: Yea, i believe in you.
  - multipleCharacter: 1
    character: {fileID: 0}
    expression: 3
    triggerExpressionAnimation: 1
    character1: {fileID: 297154306}
    expression1: 3
    triggerExpressionAnimation1: 1
    character2: {fileID: 1000891122}
    expression2: 0
    triggerExpressionAnimation2: 0
    focusCharacter1: 1
    focusCharacter2: 0
    nameToShow: Character 1
    dub: {fileID: 0}
    text: You believe in me... But why are you laughing?!
  - multipleCharacter: 1
    character: {fileID: 0}
    expression: 0
    triggerExpressionAnimation: 1
    character1: {fileID: 297154306}
    expression1: 3
    triggerExpressionAnimation1: 0
    character2: {fileID: 1000891122}
    expression2: 0
    triggerExpressionAnimation2: 0
    focusCharacter1: 0
    focusCharacter2: 1
    nameToShow: Character 2
    dub: {fileID: 0}
    text: It's nothing.
  - multipleCharacter: 1
    character: {fileID: 0}
    expression: 0
    triggerExpressionAnimation: 1
    character1: {fileID: 297154306}
    expression1: 3
    triggerExpressionAnimation1: 0
    character2: {fileID: 1000891122}
    expression2: 0
    triggerExpressionAnimation2: 0
    focusCharacter1: 0
    focusCharacter2: 1
    nameToShow: Character 2
    dub: {fileID: 0}
    text: It's just...
  - multipleCharacter: 1
    character: {fileID: 0}
    expression: 0
    triggerExpressionAnimation: 1
    character1: {fileID: 297154306}
    expression1: 2
    triggerExpressionAnimation1: 0
    character2: {fileID: 1000891122}
    expression2: 0
    triggerExpressionAnimation2: 0
    focusCharacter1: 0
    focusCharacter2: 1
    nameToShow: Character 2
    dub: {fileID: 0}
    text: Do you remember the word that i teach you.
  - multipleCharacter: 1
    character: {fileID: 0}
    expression: 0
    triggerExpressionAnimation: 1
    character1: {fileID: 297154306}
    expression1: 2
    triggerExpressionAnimation1: 0
    character2: {fileID: 1000891122}
    expression2: 0
    triggerExpressionAnimation2: 0
    focusCharacter1: 0
    focusCharacter2: 1
    nameToShow: Character 2
    dub: {fileID: 0}
    text: Phaedoari Afelgorr.
  - multipleCharacter: 1
    character: {fileID: 0}
    expression: 2
    triggerExpressionAnimation: 1
    character1: {fileID: 297154306}
    expression1: 2
    triggerExpressionAnimation1: 1
    character2: {fileID: 1000891122}
    expression2: 0
    triggerExpressionAnimation2: 0
    focusCharacter1: 1
    focusCharacter2: 0
    nameToShow: Character 1
    dub: {fileID: 0}
    text: Yeah... it means "You do not get the things you dream of, you get the things
      you work for"
  - multipleCharacter: 1
    character: {fileID: 0}
    expression: 2
    triggerExpressionAnimation: 1
    character1: {fileID: 297154306}
    expression1: 2
    triggerExpressionAnimation1: 1
    character2: {fileID: 1000891122}
    expression2: 0
    triggerExpressionAnimation2: 0
    focusCharacter1: 1
    focusCharacter2: 0
    nameToShow: Character 1
    dub: {fileID: 0}
    text: Of course i remember it, uou keep saying that almost everyday, but isn't
      dreaming also motivate us to do the thing we work too?
  - multipleCharacter: 1
    character: {fileID: 0}
    expression: 2
    triggerExpressionAnimation: 1
    character1: {fileID: 297154306}
    expression1: 0
    triggerExpressionAnimation1: 1
    character2: {fileID: 1000891122}
    expression2: 0
    triggerExpressionAnimation2: 0
    focusCharacter1: 0
    focusCharacter2: 1
    nameToShow: Character 2
    dub: {fileID: 0}
    text: Yes, i guess there's a truth in it
  - multipleCharacter: 1
    character: {fileID: 0}
    expression: 2
    triggerExpressionAnimation: 1
    character1: {fileID: 297154306}
    expression1: 1
    triggerExpressionAnimation1: 1
    character2: {fileID: 1000891122}
    expression2: 0
    triggerExpressionAnimation2: 0
    focusCharacter1: 1
    focusCharacter2: 0
    nameToShow: Character 1
    dub: {fileID: 0}
    text: Aah good timing, "Player", you will help me train today!
